sequenceDiagram
  participant Host as Host app Program.cs
  participant Cfg as LicenseConfiguration
  participant Mgr as LicenseManager
  participant Val as MongoLicenseValidator
  participant DB as MongoDB Atlas
  Host->>Cfg: AddHtmlToPdfCoreLicense key
  Cfg->>Mgr: SetLicenseKey key
  Mgr->>Val: ValidateAsync key
  Val->>DB: Find license by key
  DB-->>Val: LicenseDocument or null
  Val-->>Mgr: ValidationResult
  Mgr-->>Cfg: bool isValid plus LicenseInfo
  Cfg-->>Host: services with cached license
